            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Launchpad 0.3.11</h2>
<ul>
  <li>App icon style now refreshes the live Dock tile immediately, including after enabling Show in Dock.</li>
  <li>A custom Dock tile is installed only while Show in Dock is enabled; disabling it restores the normal bundle icon.</li>
  <li>Appearance settings explain that the selected icon is shown in the Dock.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
